# Vendored Springer Nature LaTeX template package (templates/nature/).
#
# The upstream files ship with CR-only line endings (sn-jnl.cls) and contain
# non-UTF-8 bytes. Git must not normalize them: rewriting the line endings
# corrupts the class file, and a corrupted .cls fails at \documentclass with an
# error that points nowhere near the real cause.
templates/nature/** -text
